  "description": "A high-fidelity, in-memory implementation of the Azure Cosmos DB SDK for .NET — purpose-built for fast, reliable component and integration testing. Drop-in replacements for CosmosClient, Container, and Database with full CRUD, SQL queries, LINQ, patch, bulk operations, batches, change feed, fault injection, and DI integration. Zero production code changes required with FakeCosmosHandler.",
